a tolong", "ur": "تم فریاد کرتے تھے", "bn": "তোমরা সাহায্যের জন্য ডেকেছিলে", "fa": "یاری خواستید"}}, {"text": "رَبَّكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَٱسْتَجَابَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنِّى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُمِدُّكُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِأَلْفٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُرْدِفِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "تَسْتَغِيثُونَ", "count": 1, "first": "8:9", "audio": "audio/a7785f1db4016239e8bb.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"bs": "zvali ste u pomoć", "en": "you called for help", "tr": "yardım çağırdınız", "fr": "vous avez appelé à l'aide", "id": "kalian meminta tolong", "ur": "تم نے مدد مانگی", "bn": "তোমরা সাহায্য চেয়েছিলে", "fa": "یاری خواستید"}}, {"arabic": "يَسْتَغِيثُوا۟", "count": 1, "first": "18:29", "audio": "audio/e33653f7ce83418ebab1.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"en": "they call for help", "bs": "zovu u pomoć", "tr": "yardım çağırırlar", "fr": "ils appellent à l'aide", "id": "mereka meminta tolong", "ur": "وہ مدد مانگتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা সাহায্য চায়", "fa": "یاری می‌خواهند"}}, {"arabic": "فَٱسْتَغَٰثَهُ", "count": 1, "first": "28:15", "audio": "audio/2313d190ae65a8f86154.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"]}], "gloss": {"en": "so he asked him for help", "bs": "pa ga je pozvao u pomoć", "tr": "böylece ondan yardım istedi", "fr": "alors il lui a demandé de l'aide", "id": "maka dia memintanya tolong", "ur": 